 * 6. Customer submits cancellation request for the order item
 * 7. Seller responds to the cancellation request first time (approve)
 * 8. Seller attempts to respond to the same cancellation request second time
 *
 * Validation:
 * - First seller response should succeed and update status to 'approved'
 * - Second seller response attempt should fail with 409 Conflict error
 * - Error message should indicate the request is no longer in pending status
 */
