   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor seller
   * @x-autobe-specification Query shopping_mall_shipments table by primary key (UUID). Join with shopping_mall_shipment_items to retrieve associated order items. For each shipment item, join with shopping_mall_order_items to include order item details (product, variant, quantity, price, status). Include seller information from the shipment record. Validate that the shipment exists and deleted_at is null. Return 404 if shipment not found. Authorization check: allow access only to the shipment's seller or the customer who owns the order containing the shipment items.
